      "text": "WHO did not place the worldwide number of new malaria cases in 2015 at 273 million. Multiple WHO-aligned sources (World Malaria Report 2015) estimate 214 million cases in 2015, within a range of 149–303 million. A 2025 WHO report states 230 million for 2015, not 273 million.",
